/* 精英战 2：深渊巨型触手集群（独有机制：涨潮水位倒计时与鲸油引燃） */

:: MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Sea Rocks")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Sea Rocks">><</if>>
海蚀洞底的暗潮突然咆哮着漫过脚踝，六条碗口粗、泛着幽蓝磷光的巨型触手破水而出，滑腻的吸盘喷吐着甜腥的催情水雾。洞顶悬着半桶守塔人留下的防锈鲸油，而海水正以肉眼可见的速度向胸口上涨。
<<if $danceskill gte 450 or $athletics gte 450>>你踩在湿滑的钟乳石凸起上轻巧借力，避开了第一波横扫而来的触手。
<<else>>冰冷的海水漫过小腿，几缕细小的触须已经缠上了你的靴筒。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280 or ($science or 0) gte 280>><<lanternicon>><<link [[打碎油桶 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles Oil]]>><<pass 12>><<skulduggery 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">打碎油桶 (0:12)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 280>><<trialicon>><<link [[斩断触手 (0:16)|MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles Agile]]>><<pass 16>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">斩断触手 (0:16)（体魄不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[游向出口 (0:06)|MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles Escape]]>><<pass 6>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles Oil [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你用撬棍砸裂石壁铁钩上的木桶，粘稠的鲸油顿时铺满了翻涌的潭面。随着你将防风提灯掷入水中，炽烈的蓝黄色火舌顺着水面轰然腾起，烧得巨型触手发出嘶嘶惨叫并剧烈痉挛着缩回深渊。
<<if $skulduggery gte 400 or $physique gte 11500>>趁着主触手被烈火逼退，你一把捞起了潭底露出的古沉船金币箱。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles Win">>
<<else>>受惊的触手掀起一股巨浪扑灭了半边火苗，溅起的甜腥水雾令你浑身发热。<<arousal 600>>
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[发动猛击 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles Agile]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpswimicon>><<link [[游出洞口 (0:05)|MP Elite Encounter Abyssal Tentacles Escape]]>><<pass 5>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

