/* 精英战 4：天鹅绒暗层猎艳执事团（独有机制：假面毒酒调包与水晶吊灯） */

:: MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Connudatus Street">><</if>>
天鹅绒暗层内厅的紫檀圆桌上摆着盛满筹码的金匣，戴着银狐假面的首席执事正摇晃着两杯琥珀色香槟，身后两名执事手持丝绒软鞭封住了走廊。大厅正上方悬着一盏巨大的水晶枝形吊灯，配重绒绳就系在你们手边的雕花立柱上。
<<if $seductionskill gte 500>>首席执事的目光被你的身段牢牢吸引，端着酒杯的右手不自觉地放低了防备。
<<else>>香槟杯里飘出一股甜腻的催眠药味，显然是一场鸿门宴。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mphearticon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 280>><<brothelicon>><<link [[调换香槟 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Wine]]>><<pass 12>><<arousal 300>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<garousal>><<else>><span class="disabled">调换香槟 (0:12)（魅力不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<trialicon>><<link [[割断吊灯绳 (0:14)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Chandelier]]>><<pass 14>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">割断吊灯绳 (0:14)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[混入舞池 (0:06)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 6>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Wine [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你端起桌上的水晶酒杯款款上前，用衣袖掩住杯口，在交杯换盏的刹那与首席执事的手中酒杯完成了调包。银狐执事仰头一饮而尽，不到十秒便扶着额头摇晃起来。
<<if $seductionskill gte 450 or $skulduggery gte 450>>首席执事扑通一声栽倒在波斯地毯上，两名副手顿时阵脚大乱，被你与同伴轻松击倒。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Win">>
<<else>>执事察觉到酒味有异吐出了半口，但药力已令他脚步虚浮。
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[割断配重绳 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Chandelier]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[掀翻酒桌 (0:05)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 5>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Chandelier [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _velvetScore to (($seductionskill or 200) / 10) + (($skulduggery or 200) / 10) + (($physique or 10000) / 300) + ((window.dolmp && window.dolmp.players && window.dolmp.players.size gt 0) ? 35 : 15)>>
<<if _velvetScore + random(1, 45) gte 100>>
	你拔出餐刀一刀割断立柱上的丝绒配重绳，头顶的巨型水晶吊灯轰然坠落，将执事团尽数扣在璀璨的玻璃碎片与灯架之下。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Win">>
<<else>>
	软鞭缠住了你的手腕，浓烈的催情熏香令你眼前发软，执事们将失去力气的你抬进了暗层深处的水晶展柜。<<arousal 1000>><<stress 10>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[沦为展柜缪斯 (0:10)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[裹帘撞窗 (0:08)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 8>><<pain 10>><</link>><<gpain>>
<</if>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Win [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Connudatus Street">><</if>>
你跨过满地的水晶灯碎片，拎起圆桌中央那只沉甸甸的紫檀金匣与不记名金券，与同伴从天鹅绒露台潇洒离去。
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpEliteVelvet to 1>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("elite_velvet_enforcers_win")>>
	<<money 18000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 2>><<willpower 7>><<stress -16>><<control 22>>
<<else>>
	<<money 5000>><<willpower 3>><<stress -8>><<control 10>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><<stress -4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers Escape [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Connudatus Street">><</if>>
你抓起托盘上的两副银色假面扣在自己与同伴脸上，转身混入旋转的华尔兹人群，从侧廊安全门溜回了街面。<<stress -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去峭壁街吹风 (0:08)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>


/* 精英战 5：贝利黑衣清道夫（独有机制：走廊橡木柜路障与林恩伏击哨） */

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
贝利的两名黑衣清道夫甩出包铅橡胶棍，一前一后封堵了孤儿院走廊。走廊中段立着一座塞满旧床单的笨重橡木高柜，而楼梯半层平台上方隐约可见守夜人<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>潜伏的手势。
<<if $physique gte 13000>>你抵住橡木高柜侧沿，感觉凭借自己与同伴的力气完全能将其推倒截断走廊。
<<else>>走廊狭窄，一旦被两名打手同时合围将极难招架。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<fisticon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 280>><<walkicon>><<link [[推倒高柜 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Barricade]]>><<pass 12>><<physique 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">推倒高柜 (0:12)（体魄不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[吹哨唤林恩 (0:14)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Ambush]]>><<pass 14>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">吹哨唤林恩 (0:14)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[拉闸退回阁楼 (0:05)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 5>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Barricade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你与同伴同时发力猛推走廊中段的橡木高柜，沉重的柜体轰然砸落，将冲在最前面的黑衣清道夫死死压在底板下，也将另一名打手隔绝在了走廊外侧。
<<if $physique gte 12500 or $willpower gte 600>>你们趁势夺过被压打手手中的橡胶棍，两棍敲落了后方打手的武器，连同贝利的黑金收款箱一并截获。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Win">>
<<else>>后方的打手踩着柜顶跃过障碍，但已成了孤军奋战之势。
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[合围打手 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Ambush]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">合围打手 (0:10)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[退入卧室 (0:04)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 4>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Ambush [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _baileyScore to (($physique or 10000) / 260) + (($willpower or 500) / 10) + ((window.dolmp && window.dolmp.players && window.dolmp.players.size gt 0) ? 35 : 20)>>
<<if _baileyScore + random(1, 45) gte 100>>
	随着你一声短哨，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>从半层楼梯纵身跃下，精准锁住后排打手的咽喉，你与同伴则合力将前排打手击倒在地。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Win">>
<<else>>
	橡胶棍重重砸在你的肩头，剧痛令你眼前一黑失去平衡，被两名打手直接拖进了孤儿院地底的训诫室。<<pain 20>><<stress 12>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Bailey")>><<link [[跟上押送队伍 (0:10)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement]]>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">跟上押送队伍 (0:10)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[滑下绳梯 (0:06)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 6>><<pain 10>><</link>><<gpain>>
<</if>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Win [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
两名黑衣清道夫狼狈地倒在走廊上动弹不得。贝利冷冷地看了你们一眼，没敢再上前纠缠便退回了办公室。你不仅免除了这一期的账，还当场截获了打手随身携带的 <span class="gold">£2</span>,500 黑金箱！
<<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>>
<<if ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0) lt 8>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("elite_bailey_enforcers_win")>>
	<<money 15000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><<willpower 8>><<stress -18>><<control 25>>
<<else>>
	<<money 4500>><<willpower 3>><<stress -10>><<control 10>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回卧室 (0:05)|Bedroom]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
你果断拉下走廊墙角的电闸，整条通道瞬间陷入漆黑。你拉着同伴借着熟悉的地形溜进侧门，将打手沉重的脚步声甩在了楼道另一头。<<stress -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
